						Style: note
		Text: No Offset: the Overlay stays where it would have been in the flow
			Style: label
		Frame:
			Style: stage
			Paragraph: A paragraph in the flow of the Frame.
				Style: note
			Overlay:
				Text: Overlay without Offset, after the paragraph
					Style: badge
			Paragraph: The next paragraph starts where the Overlay is, because the Overlay takes no space.
